\cf\\X/elcome to ZFinger!

This program is designed for the users to learn more about each other by asking several questions whose answers will appear in a file which all users have access to.  You may want to look at some other people's registry's before you fill yours out...  The first time you fill it out you will be prompted for infomation for each of the fields but you can go back and edit any individual field after your first time, so don't worry if you mess up.